 "post": {
  "instagram": "Fibonacci pullback in 4 steps: 1) find the move from A to B, 2) draw 50% and 61.8% of it, 3) wait for a reaction in that zone, 4) stop below the low, target the old high. Example: entry 103.61, stop 102.31, target 106.14 (about 1.9R).\n\nSave this for later and follow @calmedgeofficial for one trading concept a day.\n\nEducational example on an illustrative chart. Not financial advice; trading involves risk of loss.\n\n#fibonacci #pullback #daytradingstrategy #tradingeducation #technicalanalysis #daytrading #trading #learntotrade",
